        int sum = 0;
        int copy = n+1;
        for(int i = 1;i<=n;i++){
            if(n%i==0){
            sum = sum+i;
            }
        }
        if (sum==copy) return true;
        return false;
    }
};
```

## Complexity
**Time Complexity:** 
The loop runs from 1 to n, and for each iteration we perform a constant-time modulus operation. Therefore, the time complexity is O(n).

**Space Complexity:**
The algorithm uses only a few integer variables (sum, copy, and loop variable), so the space complexity is O(1) (constant space).

